Generates a list of all existing, new and defunct drugs.

Simply run ./generate and the following will happen:

  The LNHPD JSON data will be downloded from the Health Canada Drug Product Database (DPD):
    https://health-products.canada.ca/api/natural-licences/productlicence?lang=en&type=json
  All relevant data will be loaded into the patrick_sandbox.lnhpd_product table (replacing the existing table).
  All CSV data will be written to the file "lnhpd.<date>.csv" (used to replace all lookup items in Pine)
  The csv file will be compressed into a zip file.
  Note that no indicators are ever provided by this utility (by design).
